COMMENT     Display map based on the complete sequence of GenBank M77789.2 in
            its deposited orientation. The MCS uses the deposited polylinker
            bounds. CDS and pMB1 origin coordinates follow the NEB pUC19 map on
            L09137.2, mapped by exact circular reverse complement. Original
            accession and annotation provenance: databases/plasmids/README.md.
